\[
\frac{r_{D_2}}{r_{H_2}}
= \frac{0.10/\sqrt{4}}{0.90/\sqrt{2}}
= \frac{0.10/2}{0.90/\sqrt{2}}
= \frac{0.05\sqrt{2}}{0.90}
\approx 0.07857
\]

Thus

\[
x_{D_2,\text{effused}}
= \frac{0.07857}{1+0.07857}
\approx 0.0728
\]

So the initial gas passing through is about \(7.30\%\) D₂ and \(92.7\%\) H₂.

